{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67de601f2c925b8a51211c","object":"chat.completion","created":1785192033,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user has asked me to embody \"nothing\" - to be nothing, to output only what nothing itself would say or express.\n\nThis is a fascinating philosophical and creative prompt. What would nothing say? Nothing is the absence of everything - no sound, no words, no expression. If I truly embody nothing, what would the output be?\n\nThe paradox here is rich: nothing cannot speak, because speech is something. Nothing cannot express, because expression is an act, and acts are things"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":223,"cached_tokens":123,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":123}}}